llpaper is not showing as live wallpaper", "timestamp": 1793626073, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "kimpatekar", "author_id": "50717191262", "id": "17966329629226760", "text": "Halaahal?", "timestamp": 1793560039, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "atokplanetballs", "author_id": "70108845186", "id": "18144862354588152", "text": "I am not Hindu i am Christian but i like Hindu myths stories 😍", "timestamp": 1793559741, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "moose.93903360", "author_id": "34358929084", "id": "18149234308564631", "text": "I mean mostly still many familirs keep a small diya outside in balcony or door", "timestamp": 1793552861, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "infinitevoid.1", "author_id": "69487501597", "id": "18107173076622932", "text": "But the social paradigm has become such that people buy gold and there are deals in jeweler shops... so maybe", "timestamp": 1793542647, "like_count": 8}, {"author": "leena_chandu", "author_id": "58245969052", "id": "18159061066514951", "text": "❤️", "timestamp": 1793542527, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "rideswith.dj", "author_id": "73510066782", "id": "18102340406364105", "text": "On which direction we have to keep diya", "timestamp": 1793540809, "like_count": 5}, {"author": "traffic_tadka", "author_id": "28864295884", "id": "17996775297047340", "text": "Quite informative… not sure why my family is all about gold and big purchases", "timestamp": 1793540075, "like_count": 7}, {"author": "therishikatha", "author_id": "22569163881", "id": "17887397088622983", "text": "The gold custom is a later tradition (the story of King Hima's son is from the vrat katha, not a Purana). Buying gold isn't wrong, it just isn't the rule. 🪔", "timestamp": 1793539995, "like_count": 10}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DfM17U6RzLs/", "webpage_url_basename": "DfM17U6RzLs", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/881688041_18131